OL,3,GNEWSAHousing charity investigated by
OL,4,Aregulator
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the watchdog said it
OL,7,Fhad engaged with the charity since
OL,8,FDecember 2024 and was now launching a
OL,9,Fstatutory inquiry after it found there
OL,10,Fwas no functioning trustee board and
OL,11,Ffinancial information was filed late.
OL,13,FCumbria Community Homes declined to
OL,14,Fcomment.
